Sun Oct 18 11:00:09 UTC 2026 - Martin Pluskal <mpluskal@suse.com>

- Update to 5.24:
  * run-parts: new --after and --before options for greater
    flexibility, short option for --debug, documented --stdin
  * run-parts: forward the last exit code to preserve exit status
  * run-parts: fix failure on empty directories, error messages
    now go to stderr
  * update-shells: fix duplicated entries in special cases
  * ischroot: no longer claims it cannot run as non-root
- Run autoreconf at build time and require po4a: 5.24 ships
  no generated configure and builds translated man pages
- Spec cleanup (spec-cleaner pass)
- Switch Source to debianutils_5.24.tar.xz, upstream is a native
  package without a separate .orig tarball now; remove
  debianutils_5.4.orig.tar.xz

